{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"曾国藩·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"zeng-guofan","categoryLabel":"曾国藩","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/27_zeng-guofan/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<p>曾国藩（1811—1872），晚清&quot;中兴名臣&quot;之首、湘军创建者、洋务运动先驱，也是中国近代史上极具影响又极具争议的人物。本部分（生平与时代）回答一个问题：<strong>这个湖南寒门子弟，是如何一步步成为力挽狂澜、又毁誉两极的历史人物的？</strong> 它以时间为轴，串起他从农家少年、科举京官，到临危建军、平乱登顶、功成身退、晚年蒙尘的完整人生轨迹，并交代他所处的内忧外患的晚清时代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本部分-vs-兄弟部分的分工\">本部分 vs 兄弟部分的分工</h2><p>本人物 hub 共六个部分，本部分是&quot;时间线&quot;，其余五部分是&quot;主题切片&quot;——读懂生平，再按主题深入：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本部分（生平与时代）</strong>：人生轨迹与时代背景（叙事性、编年体）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>：修身、经世、治家三大领域的具体贡献（成果性）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>：修身之道、处世智慧、领导艺术的思想提炼（方法论）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">四大著作</a>：《家书》《日记》及辑录类著作的文本导读（文献性）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>：对后世人物、文化及当代的影响（接受史）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>：镇压起义、对外妥协等争议与总体评价（评判性）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>边界约定</strong>：本部分只在叙事需要处点到贡献、思想、争议，不展开；凡需深入，均以相对链接导向对应专章，避免重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[1 寒门子弟] --&gt; B[2 科举与仕途]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 太平天国之乱]&#10;    C --&gt; D[4 创建湘军]&#10;    D --&gt; E[5 平定太平天国]&#10;    E --&gt; F[6 晚年与身后]&#10;    F --&gt; G[再读 核心贡献/思想方法/争议评价]\">graph LR\n    A[1 寒门子弟] --&gt; B[2 科举与仕途]\n    B --&gt; C[3 太平天国之乱]\n    C --&gt; D[4 创建湘军]\n    D --&gt; E[5 平定太平天国]\n    E --&gt; F[6 晚年与身后]\n    F --&gt; G[再读 核心贡献/思想方法/争议评价]</pre><ol>\n<li><a href=\"a-scholar-from-hunan/humble-origins\">寒门子弟</a> — 家世、家训与&quot;尚拙&quot;禀性，理解一切的起点。</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-scholar-from-hunan/examination-and-officialdom\">科举与仕途</a> — 科举闯关与京官&quot;日课&quot;修身，潜伏期的厚积。</li>\n<li><a href=\"founding-the-xiang-army/the-taiping-crisis\">太平天国之乱</a> — 危机背景与临危受命的抉择。</li>\n<li><a href=\"founding-the-xiang-army/building-an-army\">创建湘军</a> — &quot;兵为将有&quot;&quot;以儒治军&quot;的制度逻辑。</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-restorer-of-the-dynasty/victory-and-power\">平定太平天国</a> — 决胜、登顶与功成身退的智慧。</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-restorer-of-the-dynasty/final-years\">晚年与身后</a> — 洋务先驱、天津教案与毁誉两极的身后。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：无需专业史学背景；若对晚清大背景陌生，可先了解鸦片战争（1840）与太平天国（1851—1864）的基本脉络，本部分各篇均会就近补足。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-scholar-from-hunan","title":"A Scholar From Hunan","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-scholar-from-hunan","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"humble-origins","title":"寒门子弟","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-scholar-from-hunan/humble-origins"},{"seq":2,"slug":"examination-and-officialdom","title":"科举与仕途","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-scholar-from-hunan/examination-and-officialdom"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-the-xiang-army","title":"Founding The Xiang Army","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/founding-the-xiang-army","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-taiping-crisis","title":"太平天国之乱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/founding-the-xiang-army/the-taiping-crisis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-an-army","title":"创建湘军","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/founding-the-xiang-army/building-an-army"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"a-restorer-of-the-dynasty","title":"A Restorer Of The Dynasty","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-restorer-of-the-dynasty","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"victory-and-power","title":"平定太平天国","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-restorer-of-the-dynasty/victory-and-power"},{"seq":2,"slug":"final-years","title":"晚年与身后","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-restorer-of-the-dynasty/final-years"}]}]}